{
  "name": "semperscribe",
  "version": "0.5.8",
  "private": true,
  "license": "MIT",
  "//": [
    "Exact pins: pdfjs-dist matches react-pdf's exact dependency so the lockfile dedupes to a single copy (two pdfjs versions = two worker bundles).",
    "mammoth is exact-pinned defensively against .docx import-parsing regressions; bump deliberately and re-run tests/services/import before releasing.",
    "zod is held at 4.4.3: 4.5.x adds a schema compiler to the classic import path, +83 KB of initial-load JS for no app feature (docs/audits/2026-09-05/bundle-attribution.md). Revisit with a zod/mini migration or a slimmer release."
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "next dev",
    "build": "next build",
    "start": "next start",
    "lint": "eslint .",
    "export": "next export",
    "test": "vitest run",
    "test:nogolden": "vitest run --exclude \"tests/golden/**\"",
    "test:golden": "vitest run tests/golden",
    "deploy": "next build && gh-pages -d out",
    "sbom": "cyclonedx-npm --output-format JSON --output-file sbom.cdx.json --omit dev",
    "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit",
    "typecheck:tests": "tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.tests.json",
    "test:coverage": "vitest run --coverage",
    "test:e2e": "playwright test",
    "lint:ratchet": "node scripts/lint-ratchet.mjs",
    "bundle:report": "node scripts/bundle-report.mjs",
    "companion": "tsx companion/server.ts",
    "companion:mcp": "tsx companion/mcp.ts"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@hookform/resolvers": "^5.9.1",
    "@modelcontextprotocol/sdk": "^1.30.0",
    "@radix-ui/react-accordion": "^1.2.20",
